VALUES(9593932, 'CW9971100', '2018-01-10 16:20:00.000', '<pre><b>2018-01-11 12:08:58</b> ** SEG187312 **<br>Caller reported that Santos Noriega is a registered sex offender. Reporter stated that Santos revealed that he watches 2 children every day while the parents go to work at the address listed on the referral.  The children are ages 4 (girl)   and 6 months(boy). Reporter provided the name: Crystal Defreitas (443 928-6816) as a person living in the home. Reporter is not sure if this is the mother of the two children. 

Reporter stated that Santos reported that he served 10 years in prison. Santos has to report Parole and Probation every 3 months to check in. Reporter stated that Santos is not on probation. 

This screener spoke with Agent Lisa Harold from the State of Maryland Division of Parole and Probation. The following information was provided: Santos is not currently under supervision, which gives him the right to babysit children. Santos is not allowed to enter schools or daycare centers. Santos has to reregister every 90 days. His next re-register date is March 5, 2018. Jennifer Berglund from the Harford County Sheriff Department is the point of contact for Santos. The case number in the Harford County Circuit Court is K02001022. The victim was a 9 year old child. 


